{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着近幾年國產車大軍壓港，考慮買車時無疑是多咗少選擇，以往都是純電動車居多，不過近年開始多番啲油電混能之選。</p><p>像首次進軍香港市場的北汽集團BAIC，便派出旗下北汽越野的B30e輕越野混能SUV打頭陣。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:24:10.608376+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T11:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:23.278734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:23.278734+00:00","content_hash":"1bea4dbfcdc34aa72d10dcd15de5684cd540c52fdc5cf3d125708c00e4f1a05e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}